<html><head><title>Student role</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px;">Without you, there would be no transdisciplinary education. Education is primarily developed for you. Therefore, you are </span><span style="margin: 0px;">a very important</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> team member. This is an opportunity to collaborate on equal footing with professionals from academia and beyond. In this collaboration, you can discover the possibilities and challenges of working in the 'real world.'</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">Additionally, this is a moment to share your ideas and make your voice heard. You are the professional of tomorrow, the new generation that can change the world. So: use this time to develop your ideas and skills, find intrinsic motivation, and change systems!</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.1167px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></body></html>